<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾱνῐκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for Pan</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Bacch.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of fears,
				<i>panic, groundless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δεῖμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					5.2.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανικόν, τό</span>, <i>panic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐμπεσόντος αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					20.6.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανικῷ περιπεσόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.96.3
				</span></i>
			: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.16
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θόρυβος ὁ καλούμενος π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					14.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τάραχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				41.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.356d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				1.2
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				36
			</span></i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανικόν</span>, a
				<i>canard, startling and baseless rumour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				14.3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.1.4
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνειον</span>.</div>
